<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-E MARCH NET UP TO PLN 11.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-E MARCH NET UP TO PLN 11.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		    1997     1996</p>
